<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply lower in heavy trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 98.81 to 6303.71.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 5.25 to 384.29.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.55.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1616 to 877.</p>
<p>Volume was 492,759,210, compared with 494,131,010 Wednesday.</p>
